    "blurb": "Validate and remediate limit orders",
    "overview": "Automatically identify errors and exceptions that require expert intervention. Involve knowledge workers only when necessary to facilitate pre-trade reconciliation. Prevent delays and cost overruns caused by manual reconciliation work.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Identify errors and exceptions before trading is filled",
    "splashDescription": "Trade processing failures caused by human errors, legacy systems, and delays in manual remediation cost banks, investment managers, and customers billions of dollars every year. The end-to-end trade lifecycle is complex and long-running. This blueprint demonstrates how to execute pre-trade reconciliation that identifies errors and exceptions and sends information to analysts immediate remediation before trading is filled. This approach resolves errors faster and avoids settlement failures.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/449343/overview/img2853389714147912316.png?f0157324798a8451c69684665b99cc35",
